1
00:00:02,550 --> 00:00:04,960
So, let's say there's
a Twitter user...

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,900
crying, and running
from the void.

3
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:09,370
And let's say
Jesus appears...

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,600
Now.

5
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,960
And he sees all of this.

6
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:24,240
So Jesus walks right
up to the void,

7
00:00:24,280 --> 00:00:26,621
Uh. Sir? That's the void.

8
00:00:26,661 --> 00:00:28,011
puts his arm around it,

9
00:00:28,051 --> 00:00:29,881
and starts whispering
in its ear.

10
00:00:29,921 --> 00:00:33,231
(whispers a joke)

11
00:00:33,271 --> 00:00:36,351
Nobody knows what he
said. I have theories.

12
00:00:40,381 --> 00:00:42,491
(HA!)

13
00:00:42,531 --> 00:00:45,551
And then the void starts
laughing. Maniacally.

14
00:00:45,591 --> 00:00:47,561
So hard, it's
coughing up stars...

15
00:00:47,601 --> 00:00:48,701
and little galaxies.

16
00:00:53,351 --> 00:00:55,431
Then Jesus looks at
the Twitter user,

17
00:00:55,471 --> 00:00:57,781
who's, like, on their ass,
with their hand up,

18
00:00:57,821 --> 00:00:59,441
and terror in their eyes.

19
00:00:59,481 --> 00:01:02,081
The void's got a pretty
good sense of humor.

20
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:04,550
Tee-hee.

21
00:01:05,754 --> 00:01:07,993
What the actual f***?!

22
00:01:10,443 --> 00:01:13,083
Now the void whispers
into Jesus's ear.

23
00:01:13,843 --> 00:01:15,153
And the whole time,

24
00:01:15,193 --> 00:01:17,203
it's side-eyeing
the Twitter user.

25
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:19,653
And Jesus is just
nodding along.

26
00:01:19,693 --> 00:01:21,203
(a slower whisper)

27
00:01:21,243 --> 00:01:23,463
No, I know. That hurts.

28
00:01:24,883 --> 00:01:25,843
I'll ask.

29
00:01:26,419 --> 00:01:27,839
Then the void
crosses its arms,

30
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:30,279
and scowls at
the Twitter user.

31
00:01:31,479 --> 00:01:33,706
The void says it
wants to talk to you,

32
00:01:33,746 --> 00:01:35,186
about something important.

33
00:01:35,860 --> 00:01:37,060
Do you have a moment?

34
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:40,461
Hell no.

35
00:01:40,501 --> 00:01:42,341
I'm not talking to
that scary thing.

36
00:01:44,583 --> 00:01:46,213
So the void rolls its eyes,

37
00:01:46,253 --> 00:01:47,453
huffs, and puffs,

38
00:01:48,053 --> 00:01:50,093
and turns its back
on the Twitter user.

39
00:01:51,273 --> 00:01:53,933
In fairness to the void,
it hears that a lot.

40
00:01:55,663 --> 00:01:57,983
And Jesus gets that
look on his face.

41
00:02:00,513 --> 00:02:01,577
Oh, boy.

42
00:02:01,617 --> 00:02:02,937
This is kind of awkward.

43
00:02:04,337 --> 00:02:07,077
So Jesus puts his hand
on the void's shoulder.

44
00:02:13,127 --> 00:02:15,554
Hey. It's okay.

45
00:02:15,594 --> 00:02:17,621
You don't have to
talk to the void.

46
00:02:17,661 --> 00:02:18,796
Wasn't planning on it.

47
00:02:18,836 --> 00:02:19,699
Fair.

48
00:02:19,739 --> 00:02:22,599
You were crying before it
ever showed up, you know.

49
00:02:24,545 --> 00:02:26,358
But what about
talking to me?

50
00:02:26,398 --> 00:02:28,676
And it doesn't have
to be about the void.

51
00:02:28,716 --> 00:02:30,115
It can be about you,

52
00:02:30,155 --> 00:02:32,298
and the emotions
that you're feeling.

53
00:02:32,338 --> 00:02:35,389
Because I want to talk to
you more about emotions!

54
00:02:35,429 --> 00:02:37,494
Because that's
meaningful to me!

55
00:02:37,534 --> 00:02:38,674
How does that sound?

56
00:02:39,844 --> 00:02:40,844
I just...

57
00:02:42,175 --> 00:02:43,075
Nope.

58
00:02:44,668 --> 00:02:47,308
And then the Twitter user
gets up, and storms off.

59
00:02:47,348 --> 00:02:49,490
Way. Too. Intense.

60
00:02:49,530 --> 00:02:52,210
And blocks Jesus.
On Twitter.

61
00:02:54,010 --> 00:02:56,310
For talking about the
void, too intensely.

62
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:59,660
And Jesus looks
back at the void,

63
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:00,950
and shrugs.

64
00:03:00,990 --> 00:03:02,920
And the void pats
him on the shoulder,

65
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:04,320
with a sad little smile.

66
00:03:06,210 --> 00:03:08,370
Too intense. Apparently.

67
00:03:10,235 --> 00:03:12,695
So Jesus puts his
arm around the void,

68
00:03:12,735 --> 00:03:15,185
and they walk off,
toward the horizon.

69
00:03:15,225 --> 00:03:18,525
So a neutron asks the bartender,
how much for a drink?

70
00:03:19,423 --> 00:03:21,723
For you? No charge.

71
00:03:24,825 --> 00:03:28,185
Jesus, smiling a bit,
telling it more dumb jokes,

72
00:03:28,225 --> 00:03:30,665
and the void, slightly
giggling, in the distance.

73
00:03:34,965 --> 00:03:37,245
Not yet. But maybe.

74
00:03:38,375 --> 00:03:40,875
Okay. Bonus scene.

75
00:03:40,915 --> 00:03:44,195
Now I'm imagining, when the
void opened up the cage,

76
00:03:44,235 --> 00:03:45,215
to my fear...

77
00:03:47,125 --> 00:03:49,635
that right behind the
big body of the void,

78
00:03:49,675 --> 00:03:52,185
the depression
magician was lurking.

79
00:03:52,225 --> 00:03:54,875
With its dagger, and
its numbing dust, ready.

80
00:03:54,915 --> 00:03:57,015
And it's, like,
licking its lips, going,

81
00:03:57,055 --> 00:03:59,915
Ooh. Fear looks very juicy.

82
00:04:00,765 --> 00:04:02,785
Can't wait to
knock Fear out.

83
00:04:07,999 --> 00:04:09,289
And the void can see it.

84
00:04:09,329 --> 00:04:11,479
Just, in the
corner of its eye.

85
00:04:11,519 --> 00:04:13,319
(a low, warm hum)

86
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:15,279
But instead of shouting,

87
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:17,309
or making it
obvious to my fear,

88
00:04:17,349 --> 00:04:19,719
that there's a creepy
magician trying to stab it,

89
00:04:19,759 --> 00:04:20,819
the void just...

90
00:04:21,649 --> 00:04:23,229
kicks the magician
in the chest,

91
00:04:23,269 --> 00:04:24,749
with its fat leg.

92
00:04:24,789 --> 00:04:27,149
And the magician goes
flying, right into

93
00:04:27,189 --> 00:04:29,269
the buckets and the
cleaning supplies,

94
00:04:32,329 --> 00:04:33,409
...How rude.

95
00:04:35,196 --> 00:04:37,619
What's...
what's that noise?

96
00:04:37,659 --> 00:04:39,209
And the void just shrugs.

97
00:04:39,249 --> 00:04:40,459
(innocent hum)

98
00:04:40,499 --> 00:04:42,459
Oh. ...Okay.

99
00:04:44,239 --> 00:04:45,539
And then it goes
right back to

100
00:04:45,579 --> 00:04:47,529
showing my fear
the galaxies.

101
00:04:47,569 --> 00:04:48,709
And the nebulae.

102
00:04:51,249 --> 00:04:52,989
Why are you
showing me this?

103
00:04:55,462 --> 00:04:58,182
To distract my fear,
from the fact that the void

104
00:04:58,222 --> 00:05:01,112
had to kick the depression
magician in the chest,

105
00:05:01,152 --> 00:05:02,802
Just so it could
have a moment,

106
00:05:02,842 --> 00:05:03,782
with my fear.

107
00:05:09,912 --> 00:05:10,812
Tee-hee.
